contentText:
Bruce Springsteen has a message for election officials on Election Day.

On Tuesday (Nov. 3), the 77-year-old music icon and longtime political activist shared a brief video message on social media, urging &#8220;election officials and representatives of our government&#8221; to ensure votes are securely counted.

